  <h2>🧵 Telegram Forum Topics & Multi-Project Channels</h2>
  <p>
    When working with multiple repositories, turn your Telegram group into a multi-channel project station:
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>In Telegram Group Settings ➔ <strong>Edit</strong> ➔ Turn ON <strong>Topics</strong>.</li>
    <li>Promote the bot to <strong>Administrator</strong> with <strong>Manage Topics</strong> permission.</li>
    <li>When you run <code>/clone</code> or <code>/newrepo</code>, the bot will <strong>automatically create a dedicated sub-channel (e.g. <code>📂 my-project</code>)</strong>!</li>
    <li>Inside that topic, you never need to specify the project name in commands — sending <code>/task "Fix auth bug"</code> or <code>/diff</code> automatically executes on that project!</li>
  </ol>
